      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure. Could you double check?\n\nWe do gatt.client_disconnect() here, and the corresponding gatt.client_connect() is located in init_device(), but that is not where handle is inserted.\nDoesn\u0027t that mean calling init_device() but not calling drop_device() would leave the gatt hanging? Or is it not possible to do so because of some ordering?",
