      "writtenOn": "2023-08-23T15:27:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah, I see. Okay, so I think we should make some additional modifications, currently we do:\n\ninit_device\nclient_connect\nclient state change\ngatt search\nsetup of change notification if found\ndrop_device\nclient_disconnect\n\nWe should probably terminate the connection if it doesn\u0027t have BAS present as there\u0027s no reason to keep it open and it means we can safely short-circuit drop_device instead of needing to call client_disconnect on every dropped device. So we should probably do:\n\ninit_device\nclient_connect\nclient_state_change\ngatt search -\u003e client_disconnect if not found\nsetup change notifications\ndrop_device\nclient_disconnect",
